Package: databoxR
Type: Package
Title: A Smart Explorer for SDTM and ADaM Clinical Trial Datasets
Version: 0.1.1.9000
Authors@R:
    person(c("Pawan", "Rama"), "Mali", email = "prm@outlook.in",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny-powered R package that provides a Windows Explorer-style interface
    for browsing, previewing, and exploring SDTM/ADaM clinical trial datasets. Provides
    quick exploratory data analysis, variable summaries, metadata labels, and basic
    variable checks.
